title: Ministers in Dresden
subtitle: Zeigner offers the party seats in the Saxon government.
new-page: true
tags: event
view-if: year = 1923 and month = 10 and e23_october_done = 0 and e23_saxony_decided = 0 and crisis = 0
max-visits: 1
priority: 3
on-arrival: {!
if (!RG.e22) { this._runActions(this.game.scenes.e22_lib.onArrival); }
RG.e22.leader();
RG.news('Zeigner offers communists seats in the Saxon cabinet', 2);
Q.e23_had_sax = Q.saxony_government ? 1 : 0;
if (Q.e23_october_path == 1) { RG.e22.octStart(); }
!}

= Ministers in Dresden

[? if e23_october_path = 1 : [+ party_leader +] is back from Moscow with the plan, the money and the Russian advisers. The first step is Saxony. ?][? if e23_october_path != 1 : The Reich is under emergency rule and Saxony is surrounded. Its government wants allies. ?]

Erich Zeigner asks the party to join his government. [? if e23_had_sax = 1 : Our ministers are already in his cabinet. Now he offers the posts that matter. ?][? if e23_had_sax = 0 : He offers the state chancellery, finance and the economy, and in Weimar two seats in the Thuringian cabinet. ?] He does not offer the interior ministry and the police. General Müller, who holds executive power in Saxony, has let it be known that he will not tolerate communist ministers.

- @enter: Enter the governments of Saxony and Thuringia.
- @police: Make the interior ministry our price.
- @outside: Stay outside, and arm the hundreds.

@enter
subtitle: [? if lock_united_front = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] A legal base, and the Saxon Social Democrats will trust us at Chemnitz.
choose-if: lock_united_front < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids sitting in a government with Social Democrats.
on-arrival: {!
RG.e22.against('united_front');
if (Q.e23_had_sax == 0) { RG.ledger('Communist ministers entered the governments of Saxony and Thuringia.', 'e23_sax_ministers'); }
RG.comply(5);
RG.setRole('brandler', 'Head of the Saxon state chancellery');
RG.news('Communists enter the Saxon government', 3);
Q.e23_saxony_decided = 1;
Q.saxony_government = 1;
Q.e23_oct_hall += 8;
RG.district('saxony', {loyalty: 6});
RG.district('thuringia', {loyalty: 6});
Q.spd_relation += 4;
RG.e22.octLines();
!}

On 10 October three communists join the Saxon cabinet, and on 16 October two more join the Thuringian. Brandler has an office in Dresden and no control over a single policeman. He asks to see the state arsenal and is shown eleven rifles.

@police
subtitle: [? if lock_united_front = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] The police armouries would open to the hundreds. Only if the Saxon SPD trusts us.
choose-if: lock_united_front < 2 and spd_relation >= 40
unavailable-subtitle: Zeigner will not hand us the police.
on-arrival: {!
RG.e22.against('united_front');
RG.ledger('A communist became Saxony\'s minister of the interior and opened the police armouries to the hundreds.', 'e23_sax_police');
RG.comply(10);
RG.ecci('trotsky', 6);
RG.news('A communist takes the Saxon interior ministry', 3);
RG.district('saxony', {guards: 3, repression: -6});
Q.e23_saxony_decided = 1;
Q.saxony_government = 1;
Q.e23_saxon_police = 1;
Q.red_guards_arms += 15;
Q.e23_oct_arms += 6;
Q.army_loyalty += 4;
RG.e22.octLines();
!}

After three nights of argument Zeigner gives way. A communist becomes Saxony's interior minister, and the police armouries open to the hundreds. In Berlin Seeckt orders Müller to prepare to march.

@outside
subtitle: No ministers for the SPD to hide behind. The hundreds get what rifles we can find.
on-arrival: {!
RG.ecci('radek', -4);
RG.district('saxony', {guards: 1.5});
Q.e23_saxony_decided = 1;
Q.saxony_government = 0;
Q.red_guards_arms += 6;
Q.e23_oct_arms += 2;
Q.e23_oct_hall -= 5;
Q.spd_relation -= 4;
Q.lean_offensive += 2;
RG.e22.octLines();
!}

[? if e23_had_sax = 1 : Our ministers resign from Zeigner's cabinet. ?] The party stays in opposition in Dresden and Weimar, and its hundreds drill in the forests of the Erzgebirge.
